@elarlang really great point! 
Support adding requirements on logging security events defined in the documentation. And adding it as a separate L2 requirement as it is separate important case for logging, and this will follow ASVS idea be usable for testing and clear for development. 

Regarding 16.3.5, as for me I would clarify this requirement with information that should be logged. This will brings more clarify and usability to it.
